From bd86cccd3696b09c8dabee45e1b56f39a5b79bbe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "mumeyong.dev" <64839630+mumeyong@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:28:19 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] OSD: macOS-style card in the top-right corner instead
 of the notch

Move the volume, mic and brightness indicator out of the dynamic island
into its own layer window: a card below the bar with a title, the level,
and a thick pill slider with the icon inside. It slides in from the
right, ignores input, and only shows on the focused monitor.
OsdService still owns the state; the notch's compact player is back to
how it was before the notch OSD.
---
 modules/services/OsdService.qml             |   2 +-
 modules/shell/osd/OSD.qml                   | 164 ++++++++++++++++++++
 modules/widgets/defaultview/DefaultView.qml |  32 +---
 modules/widgets/defaultview/NotchOsd.qml    |  77 ---------
 shell.qml                                   |  15 ++
 5 files changed, 182 insertions(+), 108 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 modules/shell/osd/OSD.qml
 delete mode 100644 modules/widgets/defaultview/NotchOsd.qml

